# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings are part of the artifact contract.
#
# eval/run_regression.py compares every archived golden project under
# examples/**/squareline/ BYTE FOR BYTE against a fresh build, and the engine
# pins LF on every host (tools/engine/squareline_engine.py -> dump_json).
#
# If git rewrote line endings on checkout — `core.autocrlf=true` is the default
# in many Windows installs — the goldens would come back as CRLF, every
# engine-written file (.spj/.sll/.slp/Themes.slt/project.info/*.fcfg) would
# differ from a Linux build, and three comparisons would go red for a reason
# that is invisible in the diff.  tools/preflight.py and the regression suite
# both guard against it; this file stops it at the source.
#
# So: normalise to LF in the repository AND in the working tree, everywhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries: never touched.
*.png  binary
*.bin  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.node binary
*.zip  binary
*.dav  binary
